1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,825
Solar is now the cheapest electricity in history.

2
00:00:03,775 --> 00:00:08,512
Since 2010, the cost collapsed by eighty-nine percent.

3
00:00:08,512 --> 00:00:16,625
It follows Swansons Law: every time global manufacturing capacity doubles, module costs drop twenty-four percent.

4
00:00:16,625 --> 00:00:20,762
Today, nothing can compete with the economics of silicon.

